            "title": "Competitors per domain",
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "How many organic competitors to return (domains ranking for the same keywords, most shared keywords first). 0 = skip this lookup. Each returned competitor is one charged result. Default 10, maximum 100. For a cheap agent check use top_keywords=0 and competitors=0 to request only the overview, without the keyword and competitor lookups.",
